Package management:

neopkg [install/uninstall] [package]: Manage packages
neopkg run: Execute a package
neopkg list: List installed packages
neopkg info [package]: Get metadata for a package
neopkg available: Download a list of packages to install
neopkg clear-cache: Clears the executable cache used by neopkg run
neopkg source [set/reset]: Set a source to download packages from
